  "outlookText": "000\nACPN50 PHFO 011703\nTWOCP \n\nTropical Weather Outlook\nNWS Central Pacific Hurricane Center Honolulu HI\nIssued by NWS National Hurricane Center Miami FL\n800 AM HST Sun Nov 01 2026\n\nFor the central North Pacific...between 140W and 180W:\n\nWell Southeast of the Hawaiian Islands:\nA broad area of low pressure is forecast to develop well to the\nsoutheast of the Hawaiian Islands in a couple of days. Thereafter,\nenvironmental conditions appear generally favorable for gradual\ndevelopment of this system, and a tropical depression could form by\nthe middle to end of the week as it moves westward to\nwest-northwestward over the Central Pacific basin.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...near 0 percent.\n* Formation chance through 7 days...medium...50 percent.\n\n$$\nForecaster Kelly\nNNNN",
